  "c17": {
   "id": "c17",
   "daoId": "capapult",
   "title": "Add USDC.inj + BTC.atom collateral, stop USDC.n growth",
   "description": "Noble USDC is being retired on Terra: TLA delisted all USDC.n pools on 26 Sep and Solid's stable pool moved to USDC.inj-SOLID (Poll #15). This poll moves Solid's collateral with it.\n\n1. USDC.n stops growing. The deposit cap is pinned to the amount deposited at execution (about 33,300 USDC today). Existing positions are unaffected: withdraw, repay and borrow work as before.\n\n2. USDC.inj (Circle USDC via Injective) becomes collateral: cap 100,000, max LTV 0.95, same liquidation settings as USDC.n.\n\n3. BTC.atom (WBTC via IBC Eureka through the Cosmos Hub) becomes collateral: cap 0.6 BTC, max LTV 0.5.\n\nSupersedes Poll #14 (USDC.n cap to 100k), which will not be executed.\n\nSignalling poll: the admin wallet executes after the vote and posts every tx hash.",
   "link": "https://app.astroport.fi/swap?chain=terra&to=ibc/E8481AD838C31D4FC12A504B10F9B4E2F830F8818D2735C2FFC707579B5FA60B",
