   "daoId": "capapult",
   "title": "Add SOLID-LUNA to the TLA incentives",
   "description": "The Terra Liquidity Alliance whitelists the SOLID-LUNA pool (Astroport xyk) in the project gauge, but it receives no Solid incentives today. Poll #15 covers LUNA-CAPA, USDC.inj-SOLID and ampCAPA.\n\nThis proposal adds SOLID-LUNA to the program: 100,000 CAPA per week for 52 weeks (5,200,000 CAPA in total) from the Solid community pool as TLA incentives (bribes) on:\n\nSOLID - LUNA (Astroport)\n\nIt supplements Poll #15 and does not replace it. Together they fund four pools at about 100,000 CAPA per pool per week.\n\nOn execution the community pool sends 5,200,000 CAPA to terra1jlpfg4gnmflvjedx9cerrkjs72gmv57as0yhw0, the same address that places the Poll #15 bids on the ERIS bribe manager. Every bid is public on-chain.",
